00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:44.540
No, nothing.

00:03:44.540 --> 00:03:46.120
My CHARM just...

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:48.080
Riri, b-behind you.

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:49.200
Huh?

00:03:57.620 --> 00:03:58.790
What are you doing, Riri?

00:03:58.790 --> 00:04:00.500
"Hitotsuyanagi Squad second year"
"Shirai Yuyu"

00:03:58.790 --> 00:04:00.500
What are you doing, Riri?

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:01.370
"Hitotsuyanagi Squad second year"
"Shirai Yuyu"

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:03.500
Y-Yuyu.

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:07.080
What's a person doing here?

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:09.040
Ah...

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:09.870
"Ah"?

00:04:09.870 --> 00:04:11.660
Ah-choo!

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:16.790
"Episode 7"

00:04:24.870 --> 00:04:29.620
We can't accomplish
anything hanging around here.

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:31.950
We did what we could, Riri.

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:33.620
Let's go.

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:38.660
Umm, would you mind if I stayed a little longer?

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:44.200
All right.

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:46.040
