00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:55.250
What are you doing here?

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:57.330
How do you do, Riri?

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:59.120
Oh, how do you do?

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:00.160
Umm...

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:00.750
Hata Matsuri, second year.

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:02.120
"Student council, second year"
"Hata Matsuri"

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:02.120
Hata Matsuri, second year.

00:05:02.120 --> 00:05:04.000
