Nice to meet you.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:06.620
P-Pardon me, Miss Matsuri!

00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:11.250
You're Yuyu's roommate, aren't you?

00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:13.540
Yuyu didn't say anything about me?

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:16.160
No, nothing.

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:18.870
Well, I expected that.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:22.790
So, this is her.

00:05:22.790 --> 00:05:27.370
But even if I weren't, you're pretty famous.

00:05:27.370 --> 00:05:29.830
Mostly in gossip, but still.

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:32.000
I... see?

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:35.750
Don't stay out here. Come in with me.

00:05:41.160 --> 00:05:44.000
Umm, why are you here, Miss Matsuri?

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:48.330
I forgot to mention,
but I'm on the student council.

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:50.830
Just filling in, though.

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:59.200
Riri still hasn't come back.

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:02.950
She must want to help the girl she saved.

00:06:02.950 --> 00:06:05.540
She has a strong sense of duty.

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:08.290
If you're worried, why not go join her?

00:06:08.290 --> 00:06:11.200
Talking isn't allowed in treatment rooms.

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:15.450
Even if Riri is there,
what could we do without talking?

00:06:15.450 --> 00:06:16.700
Visit the sick.

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:18.290
That's a surprise.

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:23.750
I figured you'd say, "There are all kinds
of things we can do without talking."

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:25.830
I see! That's a possibility!

00:06:25.830 --> 00:06:27.790
It is not!

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:34.580
Yuyu!

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:36.910
Riri.

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:39.500
Why are you so flustered?

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:41.370
Did she wake up?

00:06:41.370 --> 00:06:45.580
No, she's still sleeping. Like a log.

00:06:45.580 --> 00:06:51.950
There was something I wanted to
ask you for my tactical theory class.

00:06:51.950 --> 00:06:54.620
Oh, there's no time!

00:06:54.620 --> 00:06:56.370
The lecture's about to start!

00:06:56.370 --> 00:06:59.160
How do you do, Yuyu?

00:07:00.660 --> 00:07:02.540
You don't have classes, Yuyu?

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:06.330
I took all the credits I could in my first year.

00:07:06.330 --> 00:07:08.540
Oh, okay. See you.

00:07:08.540 --> 00:07:10.500
Farewell.

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:13.910
"Applied Close-Quarters Combat, New Edition"
"Hitotsuyanagi Riri"

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:20.910
Honestly, she's so careless.

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:29.450
Yuyu!

00:07:29.450 --> 00:07:32.330
Sorry! See you later.

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:34.750
Farewell!

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:40.080
Huh?

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:43.500
Where'd I put that textbook?

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:46.160
It's not here, either.

00:07:50.540 --> 00:07:52.500
How are you feeling?

00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:56.660
Where are you from?
What's your name? How old are you?

00:07:56.660 --> 00:08:00.580
Oh, I shouldn't ask you so many questions.

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:01.790
Sorry.

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:04.910
I'm Hitotsuyanagi Riri.

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:07.540
Ri... ri...

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:16.870
Huh?

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:18.870
Why are you looking away?

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:19.870
It's okay.

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:22.700
Let me see you laugh.

00:08:31.580 --> 00:08:34.040
My ring?

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:37.080
This... isn't my Magie.

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:38.370
Huh?

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:41.660
Yes, that girl is a Lily.

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:44.580
Miss Matsuri! And Miss Moyu.

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:44.660
How do you do, Riri?

00:08:44.660 --> 00:08:46.580
"Arsenal Division second year"
"Mashima Moyu"

00:08:44.660 --> 00:08:46.580
How do you do, Riri?

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:48.620
"Arsenal Division second year"
"Mashima Moyu"

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:48.620
We just got the results.

00:08:48.620 --> 00:08:49.160
We just got the results.

00:08:49.160 --> 00:08:52.660
Her Skiller Value,
which represents her Magie, is 50.

00:08:52.660 --> 00:08:55.950
I'm a little worried, but a Lily is a Lily.

00:08:55.950 --> 00:08:58.910
Her Skiller Value is 50?

00:08:58.910 --> 00:09:02.120
Hey, that's the same
as mine when I got accepted!

00:09:02.120 --> 00:09:05.160
What a coincidence.

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:08.040
This girl is a Lily?

00:09:09.290 --> 00:09:10.370
"Security Inspection Committee"
"Director"          "Vice Director"

00:09:10.370 --> 00:09:15.750
"Security Inspection Committee"
"Director"          "Vice Director"

00:09:10.370 --> 00:09:15.750
By the way, Takamatsu,
about the civilian you took in recently...

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:16.830
There is a girl who matches
that description. What of her?

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:20.290
"Acting chairman"
"Takamatsu Kogetsu"

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:20.290
There is a girl who matches
that description. What of her?

00:09:20.290 --> 00:09:20.540
There is a girl who matches
that description. What of her?

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:24.910
If a civilian was caught in a battle with Huge,

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:30.120
we're prepared to take custody
before it becomes a public issue.

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:33.500
Thank you, but that won't be necessary.

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:36.540
We've determined that she is a Lily.

00:09:36.540 --> 00:09:38.910
Oh? A Lily, is she?

00:09:38.910 --> 00:09:44.500
There's no need to trouble yourself.
Why not accept our proposal?

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:49.540
As you know, this academy
is a bulwark against the Huge

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:52.370
and also responsible for raising Lilies.

00:09:52.370 --> 00:09:57.120
For that reason, it has been
granted political autonomy.

00:09:57.120 --> 00:09:57.620
What difference can
a single Lily make in battle?

00:09:57.620 --> 00:10:00.330
"Student council, third year"
"Izue Shinobu"

00:09:57.620 --> 00:10:00.330
What difference can
a single Lily make in battle?

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:01.580
"Student council, third year"
"Izue Shinobu"

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:01.580
Gathering Lilies in one autonomous
institution without civilian control?

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:06.870
Gathering Lilies in one autonomous
institution without civilian control?

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:11.540
You must know how
dangerous that looks to people.

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:13.330
Naturally.

00:10:13.330 --> 00:10:21.080
The effort required to win that recognition
from all parties defied description.

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:25.870
This academy only takes in young children.

00:10:25.870 --> 00:10:31.580
And we make them bear the
brunt of exterminating the Huge.

00:10:31.580 --> 00:10:34.620
Doesn't that make us dangerous?

00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:39.080
That will be recorded as
a problematic statement.

00:10:39.080 --> 00:10:44.330
In any case, Lilies could never
become a threat to humanity.

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:48.540
I know your opinion as
a member of the first Lily generation,

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:52.950
but getting too attached
can cloud your judgment.

00:10:52.950 --> 00:10:56.040
I'd like to put one question to you:

00:10:56.040 --> 00:11:00.080
Who exactly is expressing an interest in her?

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:02.700
I don't know what you mean.

00:11:02.700 --> 00:11:04.870
That has nothing to do with you.

00:11:04.870 --> 00:11:06.410
Nothing to do with me?

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:08.040
Wait.

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:11.620
We'll call again.

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:15.580
I'm sorry to make you sit through that with me.

00:11:15.580 --> 00:11:19.290
No, it's my right as student council president.

00:11:19.290 --> 00:11:21.540
More importantly, may I ask something?

00:11:21.540 --> 00:11:26.290
What do you think of her, sir?

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:28.580
Oh!

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:32.790
Oh no, I forgot about
the practical drill tomorrow!

00:11:33.950 --> 00:11:36.160
Huh?

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:37.790
Riri?

00:11:37.790 --> 00:11:39.330
No. No.

00:11:39.330 --> 00:11:42.290
Huh? Umm, it'll be fine.

00:11:42.290 --> 00:11:43.750
I'll be back.

00:11:43.750 --> 00:11:46.450
Riri... don't go.

00:11:46.450 --> 00:11:50.910
Riri has to go now.
Make do with me while she's gone.

00:11:50.910 --> 00:11:52.660
No!

00:11:54.410 --> 00:11:55.950
Heartbreaking.

00:11:55.950 --> 00:12:00.250
Should I... stay here?

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:02.410
Okay, let's try this:

00:12:02.410 --> 00:12:06.080
Riri, you'll be her caretaker for now.

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:10.450
I'll get the academy to help out
with your classwork and legion duties.

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:13.790
What? You don't need to do all that.

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:18.410
The acting chairman
personally entrusted me with her.

00:12:18.410 --> 00:12:21.450
I can relax if you're with her.

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:24.410
I'll let your legion know.

00:12:24.410 --> 00:12:26.000
Oh, no.

00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:29.160
Please, let me tell them.

00:12:31.120 --> 00:12:33.580
That girl was a Lily.

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:35.870
Did you find out who she is?

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:39.580
Well... it looks like she
can't remember anything.

00:12:39.580 --> 00:12:45.450
I hate to intrude, Riri, but aren't
you getting too attached to her?

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:50.160
She must have family and
precious friends somewhere.

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:55.870
Not being able to remember them
must be like losing her whole self.

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:59.500
So, I want to at least stay with her.

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:06.160
But you do understand that it
doesn't have to be your job, don't you?

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:11.620
You're... probably right, but...

00:13:11.620 --> 00:13:14.080
You're the Hitotsuyanagi Squad's leader.

00:13:14.080 --> 00:13:18.410
No one else can fill your shoes.

00:13:19.620 --> 00:13:22.870
We can't, so we won't.

00:13:22.870 --> 00:13:26.790
But we'll have to figure something out anyway.

00:13:26.790 --> 00:13:28.750
Don't worry, Riri.

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:31.040
R-Right!

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:32.620
Thank you so much.

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:34.540
I know it's selfish of me.

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:38.330
It's not selfishness; it's compassion.

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:39.910
Be proud of it.

00:13:39.910 --> 00:13:45.080
These days, everyone knows
someone who's been hurt.

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:48.700
Of course you want to reach out if you can.

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:51.370
That's right. I'm jealous.

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:53.290
I know how you feel.

00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:56.450
I don't object either.

00:13:56.450 --> 00:13:57.870
Ask anything of me!

00:13:57.870 --> 00:14:00.250
I'll help out, too.

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:03.660
Everyone... thank you so much.

00:14:04.790 --> 00:14:07.370
Okay, I'm off!

00:14:11.040 --> 00:14:13.160
No one can talk her out of things,

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:17.910
but she's still not skillful enough
to pull off many things at once.

00:14:17.910 --> 00:14:21.910
You said it. Never a dull moment with her.

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:30.750
Is something the matter, Miss Yuyu?

00:14:30.750 --> 00:14:32.250
What?

00:14:32.250 --> 00:14:38.080
Miss Yuyu, despite what you said,
you're uneasy, aren't you?

00:14:38.080 --> 00:14:39.200
A little.

00:14:39.200 --> 00:14:41.500
Do you have a chill in your chest?

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:43.660
I... suppose I might.

00:14:43.660 --> 00:14:46.580
Does it ache like a hangnail?

00:14:46.580 --> 00:14:48.330
How did you know?

00:14:48.330 --> 00:14:51.870
That's jealousy, Miss Yuyu.

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:03.290
Jealous? Me? Of whom?

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:08.500
Of that girl Riri cares
so much about, of course.

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:10.540
You look pleased, Kaede.

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:12.080
Of course I am.

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:15.660
Miss Yuyu, feared by her
comrades as a lone wolf,

00:15:15.660 --> 00:15:18.080
is suffering Riri withdrawal!

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:19.700
It's hilarious!

00:15:19.700 --> 00:15:21.120
Riri <i>what</i>?!

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:25.870
And I have a bit more experience
than you in that department!

00:15:25.870 --> 00:15:28.700
You're proud of that?

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:31.200
Are you in, Miss Moyu?

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:32.950
Hey there, Gropi.

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:35.540
Must you call me that?

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:36.580
Isn't it cute?

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:38.790
It's creepy!

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:41.870
You're always in high demand, Miss Moyu.

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:44.290
Being multitalented has its downsides.

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:49.790
I'd love to invent an octopus CHARM
with ten telepathically controlled arms.

00:15:49.790 --> 00:15:52.330
Wait, do octopuses have eight arms?

00:15:52.330 --> 00:15:54.290
Or was it six?

00:15:54.290 --> 00:15:56.000
You're overworked.

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:58.700
CHARMs and Lilies are linked through Magie.

00:15:58.700 --> 00:16:01.540
Lilies and Huge fight using Magie.

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:04.040
Isn't it just too funny?

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:07.500
That said, human hearts are
totally out of my wheelhouse,

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:11.250
so I'm grateful for Riri's help with this one.

00:16:11.250 --> 00:16:13.500
Why Riri again?

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:19.500
She made the discovery...
or should I say, "first contact"?

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:23.250
It's true that Riri is often close to people.

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:24.540
Physically.

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:30.250
Actually, Riri is part of
what I'm studying this time.

00:16:30.250 --> 00:16:32.410
Are they connected somehow?

00:16:32.410 --> 00:16:35.160
That's what I want to find out.

00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:38.370
I haven't told her, though.
It would affect the data.

00:16:38.370 --> 00:16:42.160
If they've put you on this,
Miss Moyu, it must be serious.

00:16:42.160 --> 00:16:45.200
But is it something you ought to share with me?

00:16:45.200 --> 00:16:47.700
Oh no! This is confidential.

00:16:47.700 --> 00:16:51.660
Fear not. I won't tell a soul.

00:16:51.660 --> 00:16:56.370
Okay. I'll use every means and route
I've got to ruin your life if you do.

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:59.410
Straight to threats?

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:03.330
Still, it's strange, isn't it?

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:09.660
If that girl is a Lily, there should
be a missing Lily somewhere.

00:17:09.660 --> 00:17:14.700
To be precise, a number of Lilies
have gone missing in the past,

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:18.540
but none of them match that girl's description.

00:17:18.540 --> 00:17:21.500
Maybe she just awakened as a Lily?

00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:23.500
Oh, that could be.

00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:24.410
But...

00:17:24.410 --> 00:17:28.200
In that case, I'll ask my father as well.

00:17:28.200 --> 00:17:32.250
The ultra-first-class CHARM manufacturer
Grand Guignol's intelligence capabilities

00:17:32.250 --> 00:17:34.660
are better than even the academy's.

00:17:34.660 --> 00:17:37.200
Whoa. Creepy.

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:39.160
It's the truth.

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:41.200
Riri, ah.

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:44.080
Come on, can't you eat on your own?

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:46.830
I want you to do it. Ah.

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:49.580
Eat it yourself!

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:52.040
You're like her mom, Riri.

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:53.290
"Mom"?

00:17:53.290 --> 00:17:56.080
A-At least make it "big sister."

00:17:56.080 --> 00:17:57.660
"Sister"?

00:17:57.660 --> 00:18:01.120
Hey, isn't it time you gave her a name?

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:02.410
Is it?

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:05.000
It's inconvenient without one, right?

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:07.870
Y-You want me to name her?

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:27.200
"Nami, Aimu, Akua, Sango, Shiho, Yui"

00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:31.290
"First year"
"Ito Shizu"

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:12.160
How do you do, Yuyu?

00:19:15.660 --> 00:19:18.750
Do you mind if I join you?

00:19:18.750 --> 00:19:21.120
No, go ahead,

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:22.700
Riri.

00:19:24.330 --> 00:19:28.370
I haven't seen you in so long, Yuyu!

00:19:29.700 --> 00:19:31.120
What's wrong?

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:33.000
Keep it together.

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:36.750
"Applied Close-Quarters Combat, New Edition"
"Hitotsuyanagi Riri"

00:19:37.040 --> 00:19:39.330
That's my textbook!

00:19:39.330 --> 00:19:41.910
You were holding onto it, Yuyu?

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:43.830
Only by accident.

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:44.450
--Thank you so much!

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:47.370
--Honestly, I can't stand to listen to them.
--Thank you so much!

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:49.290
Wipe your tears on this.

00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:51.160
I'm not crying!

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:58.790
You're the girl from...

00:19:58.790 --> 00:20:01.250
Oh, are you feeling well now?

00:20:01.250 --> 00:20:03.040
Wait, that uniform!

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:07.120
Yup, I got her made
an official Yurigaoka student.

00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:09.120
You mean she's been admitted?

00:20:09.120 --> 00:20:10.790
She's adorable.

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:12.870
Come on, say hello.

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:14.660
This is Miss Yuyu.

00:20:14.660 --> 00:20:16.000
Yuyu?

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:18.870
Come on, we practiced this.

00:20:18.870 --> 00:20:20.700
Introduce yourself.

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:21.830
What for?

00:20:21.830 --> 00:20:24.040
What is it with Riri and this girl?

00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:26.290
They're like sisters.

00:20:26.290 --> 00:20:28.500
Hey, it's getting cramped here.

00:20:28.500 --> 00:20:29.870
Push closer together.

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:32.120
I want to see, too.

00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:33.410
What're these?

00:20:33.410 --> 00:20:36.290
Scones. Would you like to eat one?

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:39.200
I see you're a glutton, like a certain someone.

00:20:39.200 --> 00:20:40.950
You mean me?

00:20:40.950 --> 00:20:43.950
It looks like you've got another Schild, Yuyu.

00:20:43.950 --> 00:20:45.000
Can I eat it?

00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:46.830
Wipe your hands properly.

00:20:46.830 --> 00:20:48.620
They're less sisters...

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:50.700
And more mother and daughter.

00:20:50.700 --> 00:20:52.580
Yuyu, are you my mom?

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:53.830
I didn't birth you.

00:20:53.830 --> 00:20:55.040
Then you're my dad?

00:20:55.040 --> 00:20:56.540
I am not.

00:20:56.540 --> 00:20:59.870
So, did you find out her name?

00:20:59.870 --> 00:21:03.580
Oh, actually, her memory hasn't come back yet.

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:06.200
What have you been calling her, then?

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:06.870
--Huh?

00:21:06.870 --> 00:21:07.500
--It's been nearly a week.
--Huh?

00:21:07.500 --> 00:21:09.500
--It's been nearly a week.

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:10.700
Well...

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:13.790
Tell us, Riri.

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:14.950
Yuri.

00:21:14.950 --> 00:21:15.620
--What?

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:16.450
--Oh, you see...
--What?

00:21:16.450 --> 00:21:17.410
--Oh, you see...

00:21:17.410 --> 00:21:19.790
I'm Yuri. Riri said so.

00:21:19.790 --> 00:21:24.250
Th-That's just a temporary name
until I thought of a real one!

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:26.660
Yuri, time to eat.

00:21:26.660 --> 00:21:29.120
Yuri, let's read a book.

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:31.870
Yuri, let's go take a bath together.

00:21:31.870 --> 00:21:36.620
That's the couple name
I gave to you and Miss Yuyu!

00:21:36.620 --> 00:21:38.830
Well, um, you see...

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:41.450
Oh my, isn't that lovely.

00:21:41.450 --> 00:21:43.660
I think... it suits her.

00:21:43.660 --> 00:21:46.500
It's like she's the fruit of your love.

00:21:46.500 --> 00:21:49.040
Want to try cat food with me?

00:21:49.040 --> 00:21:53.330
Faits accomplis are piling up before I know it!

00:21:53.330 --> 00:21:54.830
It's decided, then.

00:21:54.830 --> 00:21:57.790
I'll register her to our legion under that name.

00:21:57.790 --> 00:21:58.750
Fumi?!

00:21:58.750 --> 00:22:02.700
I'll make her last name
Hitotsuyanagi for now, okay?

00:22:02.700 --> 00:22:05.700
Well... I suppose it's fine. Right, Riri?

00:22:05.700 --> 00:22:07.000
Tashty.

00:22:07.000 --> 00:22:10.200
Oh, give me one as well.

00:22:10.290 --> 00:22:13.790
"Her name shall be Hitotsuyanagi Yuri.
-Riri"

00:22:14.910 --> 00:22:19.000
You made her a student? That was drastic.

00:22:19.000 --> 00:22:26.200
A Lily should receive proper treatment
as a Lily, whatever her past.

00:22:27.700 --> 00:22:34.040
And this should force the people
snooping in the shadows out into the open.

00:22:34.040 --> 00:22:37.040
"To be continued"

00:24:07.000 --> 00:24:08.080
"Next time"
"Episode 8"

00:24:08.080 --> 00:24:09.910
"Next time"
"Episode 8"

00:24:08.080 --> 00:24:09.910
Next time, Yuri faces a trial!

00:24:09.910 --> 00:24:12.040
"Next time"
"Episode 8"

00:24:09.910 --> 00:24:12.040
Good luck, Yuri!

00:24:12.040 --> 00:24:16.950
"Illustration: Arai Teruko"
